# Findings in jspdf and dompurify packages that are bundled as transitive
# dependencies of the pnpm workspace but are NOT used by the API at runtime.
# These are front-end PDF/DOM libraries pulled in via the workspace node_modules;
# the API never imports or executes them. The attack surface does not exist
# server-side. Tracked for removal in: https://github.com/SirNnadi/AfricAir/issues
#
# To verify: grep -r "jspdf\|dompurify" server/src/ → no results

